WEBVTT

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.890
Why?

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:19.640
It's the day before Comic Festival, 
and I'm not excited at all.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:24.750
It's Comic Festival! I used to get
 so excited, it was kind of stupid.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.620
What happened to me?

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.290
You look happy, Kanako.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:10.710
No wonder!

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:15.090
Today I get to cosplay with everybody!

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.770
Everybody was busy with 
their own things yesterday,

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.140
but today I'm counting on you!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.030
Okay!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:25.220
So you're going straight back to America 
after Comic Festival is over, Angela-san?

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.700
You must really love it!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.330
She's tough! She does 
tennis and swimming too!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:34.790
They're really excited today.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:36.520
Especially Ohno-san.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.530
They've been like that since yesterday.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:41.920
I won't deny that cosplay is fun.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.810
Anyway, isn't Madarame-sempai late?

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.620
We need him for our plan!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.270
Is that him?

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.590
Sorry, am I the last here?

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:57.180
Don't worry. There's still 
time before the first train.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.530
That's good.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.540
Good morning, Madarame-sempai. 
It's been a while.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:05.240
Oh, uh, morning.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.000
Is that you, Hato-kun?
 I didn't know you had a wig like that.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.380
Let's get moving.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.830
Hey, it's been forever, Kugayama.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.900
Since graduation, yeah.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:20.420
That's right, sempai can only talk 
to me normally when I'm a guy.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.340
You look a little pale, Madarame.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.530
I'm a bit hungover.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.680
Hungover?

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.930
Hey, do you remember?

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.290
Last summer at the room.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.630
When we were reading an 
anime magazine together,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.420
you flipped the pages 
with these fingers.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.350
Come on, Kanako! Interpret!

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.850
N-No.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.250
I don't get it at all.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.060
That really happened!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:55.020
Well, I skipped some things, though.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.650
Hey, it doesn't make sense.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.460
What is this? What is this?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.210
Dunno.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:03.660
I think, basically, she wants to say thanks 
for helping her last year in the club room.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.620
I'm not sure I really understand her, though.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.470
Last summer in the club room? 
That's a long time ago.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:15.390
I don't really remember, 
but you're welcome.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.250
He doesn't remember.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.630
Oh. That's a shame.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:27.260
I could return the
favor in a different way.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.580
Stop that.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.580
Go Next!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.520
Angela-san's still clinging to him.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.050
She's so aggressive.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:01.800
Can we assume there's 
something going on?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:07.730
I read on the net once that Japanese
 guys are really popular overseas.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.070
I don't think that's true.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:12.020
I don't know, but what 
we're seeing here--

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.240
I'm sure she's bothering Madarame-sempai.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.160
He still likes Kasukabe-sempai.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.360
But I probably shouldn't try to interfere.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:26.420
He avoids me when I'm a girl, anyway.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.060
Ohno-sempai!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:30.850
Yes?

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.330
Madarame-sempai said he was hungover.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:38.190
Can I go help him buy doujinshi today?

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.900
I was really looking 
forward to today though!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.310
I see.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.150
I'm sorry. Please.

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:50.410
Well, you did it yesterday, 
and the day before.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.700
Thank you.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.940
Madarame-sempai! Kuchiki-sempai!

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.620
The male version!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.650
I'll be going with you guys.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.750
I think it works.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.000
W-What does?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.260
Thanks for the help.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.090
Why are you giving a thumbs up?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:21.000
I thought we could cosplay all 
the main characters, but...

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.460
Probably that's guided 
by the law of cycles.{Madoka reference.}

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.840
Can I ask you something by now?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:31.430
What was that in this morning?
 Since when do you like Madarame so much?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.130
I told you then.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.970
He was kind to me when I 
came to Japan last summer.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:39.850
But you weren't flirting 
with him in winter!

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.730
That's not surprising.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.540
He had Saki.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.070
But Saki graduated.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.150
And Madarame was left 
broken-hearted, right?

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.410
You know what I think?
 Madarame deserves to be happier.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.640
And isn't it about time 
he finds a new love?

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.490
Don't scare me!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.200
I don't get it at all.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.790
It's perfect for you.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:10.530
But if Ogiue-san was here 
you'd do my character, right?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.130
What?

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:16.140
I agreed to dress like this because 
we were all going to do it.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.010
That Hato... I should've quit too.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:22.590
I need you here for my character, though!
 We're a couple!

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:26.000
And don't you think Hato-chan's 
fine where she is?

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:27.750
Why?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:32.810
A guy, dressed like a guy, is going with 
his guy friends to buy doujins for guys.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.390
No problem, right?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.010
I guess.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.730
No, I mean that should be just fine.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.350
I don't understand them.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.710
Hato-kun, you get all your stuff?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.900
You too?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.090
Yeah, I got all the stuff on the list.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.680
But you being here helped a lot.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:57.290
It meant I had less to buy. Thanks.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.120
It's fine.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.110
How are you feeling?

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:02.950
I'll be fine once the 
alcohol's out of my system.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:05.080
A junior caring for him sempai!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.250
Did you drink that much?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.160
It's been really hot lately.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.960
I can't concentrate. Get lost.

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.970
I'll head upstairs for now.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.160
I'm everywhere and nowhere, you know!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:22.230
Anyway, what do you think of day three?
  There's more people here, right?

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.670
There's people everywhere. 
It's overwhelming.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.690
Yesterday I only went 
to the women's booths.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:32.590
Oh yeah. Yesterday was what 
you were really here for.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.660
Dorarara?

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:37.840
Yes, that's right.
 I searched everywhere for stuff.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.160
And in cosplay too.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.160
Tanaka-san's really good,
 to be able to make that overnight!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.690
That's a real turnabout!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:51.760
A female character who dresses like a guy. 
I'm cross-dressing, but at the same time I'm not!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.930
And since it comes with pants 
I can stand up in the bathroom.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.600
<b>End of the Line (#2)</b>

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:00.390
Or so I thought.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.820
I'm glad you're having a good time.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.060
When I was a student, 
I came all three days,

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:12.780
bought all the doujinshi,
 and lined up at all the company booths.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.680
Company booths?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.240
You don't know about them?
Second floor of the west hall.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.780
Lots of companies are there, but it's mostly 
H-game developers and publishing companies.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.970
They all hold events and sell con exclusives.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.670
I didn't know they had 
that here. I'll go later.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.380
Once, I tripped in a line here 
and fractured my hand.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:34.840
But I still stayed in line and bought 
stuff at those booths. Those were the days.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.480
Fractured your hand?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:38.460
The indiscretions of my youth.{I think this might be a Gundam reference, so I've reworded it accordingly.}

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:42.240
And now that I'm out of school, 
I can only go for one day.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.350
It kinda puts out my fire.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.230
No, I don't think that's the problem.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.150
For me, it's all in my head.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:57.350
But it was hot in 
another way, wasn't it?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.810
The temperature?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.590
No... Angela-san.

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:05.260
No, no, no.
 She's just making fun of me.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:07.830
Is she? You don't think it's 
finally your turn to get lucky?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:12.040
It's a lie that everybody gets
 lucky once in their life. I never have.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:16.100
She only comes to Japan
 for Comic Festival, anyway.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.970
She's just messing around.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.970
Forget 3D girls! 2D for the win.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.180
And I got plenty of them today.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.930
Um...

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:30.680
Then have you ever
fallen in love with a 3D girl?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:31.940
Huh?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.860
Never.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.690
He's lying.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:42.160
No. It's not fair to keep asking
these questions when I saw those photos.

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:45.520
But if she knew the real you,

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.650
I think a girl would
 really like being around you.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.950
What's gotten into you?

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.130
You're a good cook.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.510
And you treat somebody
like me like a normal person.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.960
You're <i>sure</i> you aren't into guys, right?

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.260
I-I'm not!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.870
The only 3D people I've ever 
fallen in love with were girls.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.020
Is that after you got into BL?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.010
Yes!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.980
Oh, hey. There you are.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.140
Hello there, Kugayama-sempai!

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.920
Hey. It's really hot, huh?

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:23.620
Good timing, Kugayama.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.410
Hato-kun said he wanted to 
check out the company booths.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.200
That's right.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.920
Can you keep our place?

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.670
Sure. I'll just be reading my doujins.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:41.060
I think those two are really 
suspicious, Kugayama-san!

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.930
But I guess normal people don't care.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:52.560
No matter what you say,
 she's got a boyfriend already.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.940
Even in an H-game,
 it would never happen.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:58.150
And what a boyfriend.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:02.960
I'm gonna feel like a loser
for the rest of my life.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.650
Well, how do I approach 
him on the way back?

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.780
So this whole floor is company booths.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.390
Wow, there's so many!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:25.670
Madarame-san!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:31.360
I was just thinking of contacting you.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.790
Kousaka!

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:37.250
W-Why? And why are you--

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.240
I've been recruited to help advertise.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.650
Our new H-game is about traps.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:48.140
I've fit Hato-kun up for the clothes...

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:48.890
What?

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:53.640
Actually, I wanted Ogiue-san to 
cosplay this character, though.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.350
Hato-kun's also fabulous,

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:59.480
but we may want to find someone smaller.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:04.510
And if she were here, Hato-kun 
would cosplay this one!

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.490
Yeah, should be this.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:08.530
Yeah.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:13.000
If Ogiue-san would do...
 well, she won't change her mind though.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:17.770
Hey, what's wrong, Sue?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.860
You want to cosplay this one?

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.550
But you're blonde!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:30.030
Anyway, I don't think Ohno-sempai 
works as a middle schooler.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.490
Yeah, she's too busty.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:40.070
Madarame-san says Kousaka-san is
 cosplaying as girl at the company booths!

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.360
And he sent a picture!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.030
Wow.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:44.870
What a natural!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.300
I want to go see!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:50.390
But I can't leave by myself. 
This is a group cosplay!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.340
And Kousaka-san is
 working so he can't come here!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.800
And going anywhere in
 this crowd is impossible!

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:01.480
This is Kasukabe-sempai's boyfriend?

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.130
Ohno-san says she wants more pictures.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.210
Sure.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.780
In other words,
 he's Madarame-sempai's rival.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.810
Okay, ready?

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:14.600
Yeah, I don't think he can win.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.150
Win what?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:20.240
Kuchiki-kun sent a selfie.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.440
Oh, he's in line.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.730
"Gimmie an upskirt?"

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.090
I guess they're rivals, 
but they get along.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.600
I can't get in between them!

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:38.450
Are they going to fight 
over Kasukabe-sempai?

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:40.060
I guess not.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:45.030
They're already dating, so 
Madarame-sempai watches from a distance.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:48.660
I can see it in my mind's eye.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.950
Even I think his 
crossdressing is perfect.

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:59.210
Wait? Are you not wearing 
makeup, Kousaka-sempai?

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:00.950
That's right.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:05.680
It's hopeless, Madarame-sempai.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.460
What's that?

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.140
I guess in that case,

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:17.390
dating Angela-san is 
the best option for him.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:18.640
Come on.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.120
No, that doesn't seem quite right.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.060
What? Still shocked by Kousaka?

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.550
Your crossdressing is amazing too.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:31.530
Kohsaka's just a natural. Don't worry about it.
 He's from a different dimension.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.260
Anyway, I'm not gonna win.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:58.500
I think in general terms, 
I'm as good as he is.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.420
So you...

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.960
You shouldn't say you can't win.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:06.560
What did you say? I couldn't hear you.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:13.660
I want him to try just a little harder.

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:17.580
It may just be me being selfish.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.260
But isn't everything I want like that?

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.610
Stop it, please.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.050
You're bothering him.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.380
It's just about what I want.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.150
Interpret, Kanako.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.200
Okay.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:40.580
But...

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:44.840
Even if it may be a one-night stand,

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:50.030
it could be a very memorable 
event in your life.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.240
A one-night stand?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.640
I'm so jealous!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:56.590
I-I don't think so!

00:16:56.930 --> 00:17:01.430
I'm sure a feeling that develops 
over time is much stronger!

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:06.440
I believe the feeling that you have 
developed over time is surely stronger.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:10.560
Oh, you forgot what 
happened in the morning?

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:14.110
I told you, I have been fancying 
Madarame since last year.

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.560
Now is just a trigger.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.850
And it's <i>our</i> right to make 
a decision for the future.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.810
It's nothing for an 
outsider to interfere with.

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:30.000
She's really aggressive.

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:33.710
It's so direct that translating 
it is embarrassing.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.510
Hang in there.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.760
It doesn't matter whether I'm an outsider,
 or what rights I have.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.430
Because Madarame-sempai...

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.250
...likes Kasukabe-sempai!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.160
Madarame-sempai...

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.630
Sempai...

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:57.660
He's a bottom!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.400
Hey!

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.080
He's what we call a bottom in BL!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:06.430
And he's a damn good one,
 so he should be paired with a guy!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.990
Like Tanaka-sempai x Madarame-sempai!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:09.940
You picked me?

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.980
Or Kugayama-sempai would be great too!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.270
N-No I wouldn't.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:16.910
Or even Kuchiki-sempai trying 
to be a top and failing!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.530
He's not here, but Sasahara-sempai 
would work too!

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.910
But my personal favorite right now...

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.970
... is the love I saw today!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.530
Shut up already!

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.750
Kousaka-sempai x Madarame-sempai!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.120
Now who should I send this picture to?

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:36.660
Stop it, please...

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:46.020
So Madarame-sempai
 doesn't have time to date a girl.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.280
What am I saying?

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.440
I can't breathe! I can't look at him!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.650
Madarame... total bottom?

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.610
Yes! Total bottom.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.660
Yes! Total bottom!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.240
Total bottom! Total bottom!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.730
Madarame the total bottom!

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:07.220
Angela, I forgot you liked that stuff.

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:10.230
But that is that.

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.170
My fingers again?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:28.160
Oops, you got really uptight?

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:35.200
Chai... Chai Kick! {Reference to History's Strongest Disciple Kenichi}

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.830
Ouch!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.570
Oh... my.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.400
Hato!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.230
Good job!

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:48.310
See you at the next Comic 
Festival, Madarame!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.590
Yankee go home!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.260
Go to hell!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.090
What was that?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.740
I'm not entirely sure.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.890
Um, I'm sorry for the 
weird things I said.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:04.990
Nah, you saved me, so it's okay.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:07.140
But one thing...

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:14.970
Where did you get that thing about 
a feeling that develops over time?

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:19.740
It just came to me.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.700
I see. Fine then.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.530
Hato-chan's one of us, isn't she?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.810
Excuse me.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:32.000
You should be more careful 
with these things!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.370
Sorry.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.750
And what happened to Hato X Madarame?

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:43.790
I'm a bottom?!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:49.600
It was a big shock for us to accept him.
 It was a big shock for all of us.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.190
No, I think it's a bigger shock for him.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:57.150
Is he forgetting how close 
he came to a girl's boobs?

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.640
And that's the end of
 this year's Comic Festival!

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:47.570
Okay, calm down.
 It's not time to freak out yet.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:49.890
"Bottom" is just a concept that 
exists in a rotten girl's head.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.510
It doesn't affect me in reality.

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:02.120
I'm not sure if Sasahara lets his
girlfriend use him in BL 'cause he's tough,

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:03.880
or if Madarame is just delicate.

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:09.110
While I'm sure tastes will vary,
 I think that's probably what makes him good for BL.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:13.160
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:12.300
Comic Festival was so much fun!

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.160
I bought too much, my legs are 
sore, and I can't lift my arms.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:17.380
Really? I'm just fine.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.500
It started to get to 
me on the second day.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:21.080
Me too.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.710
You're still fine, Yoshitake-san?

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:23.330
Really?

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:25.720
No, it hit me the first day.

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:27.710
I've had torn muscles and everything!

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:29.510
Torn muscles are a
 pretty big deal, aren't they?

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:31.930
It takes two or three weeks
to heal, if you're lucky.

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:33.080
She's got so much energy.

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:34.420
And she's so excited to cosplay.

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:35.060
Farewell!

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:35.970
She ran!

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.100
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation: </i>
Shout "Moe!" Beyond the Event Horizon {Reference to an old drama, shout love at the heart of the world. Which I think came from a Harlan Ellison short story?}{The line recurs a lot in Evangelion-related stuff, I think it was parodied in Anno's Cutey Honey stuff.}
